{"1345240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shuffs", "steam_appid": 1345240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Shuffs is a physics-based puzzle game which makes use of platforming controls as a means of manipulating your environment through the use of whatever projectiles you can find. Armed with nothing but a bindle and your own resourcefulness, set off on a journey full of head-scratching puzzles, action-packed boss fights and funky stunt shots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaster your control over such projectiles as frogs, rats, and spiders, each with different effects and behaviours to learn. Face up against a series of hair-tearing puzzles and trick shots, designed to turn you into the biggest badass a straw-stuffed, little dummy can be.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHone your skills across 38 levels and 24 unlockable bonus levels, throughout farms, swamps and derelict industrial estates, ridden with a gang of cockroaches known as the Pink Eye Boys. To complete the story can take as little as 3-4 hours, but it's a tough game, so you'll probably end up getting much more than that out of it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut most of all, just have fun. You're probably not gonna be good at this right away.*<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*See a doctor if you are good at this right away, 'cause you are totally sick, yo!", "about_the_game": "Shuffs is a physics-based puzzle game which makes use of platforming controls as a means of manipulating your environment through the use of whatever projectiles you can find. Armed with nothing but a bindle and your own resourcefulness, set off on a journey full of head-scratching puzzles, action-packed boss fights and funky stunt shots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaster your control over such projectiles as frogs, rats, and spiders, each with different effects and behaviours to learn. Face up against a series of hair-tearing puzzles and trick shots, designed to turn you 